</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Unresting, unhasting, and silent as light,</l><l>Nor wanting, nor wasting, Thou rulest in might;</l><l>Thy justice like mountains high soaring above</l><l>Thy clouds which are fountains of goodness and love.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To all life Thou givest, to both great and small;</l><l>In all life Thou livest, the true life of all;</l><l>We blossom and flourish as leaves on the tree,</l><l>And wither and perish, but nought changeth Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Great Father of Glory, pure Father of Light</l><l>Thine angels adore Thee, all veiling their sight;</l><l>All laud we would render, O help us to see:</l><l>’Tis only the splendor of light hideth Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Immortal, invisible, God only wise,</l><l>In light inaccessible hid from our eyes,</l><l>Most blessed, most glorious, the Ancient of Days,</l><l>Almighty, victorious, Thy great name we praise.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
